OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few scattered early showers,
OL,6,Fotherwise dry with some good spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine during the morning and early
OL,8,Fafternoon. High cloud will then
OL,9,Fincrease from the southwest. Moderate
OL,10,Fnortherly winds becoming light and
OL,11,Fvariable.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShetland staying dry this
OL,14,Fevening. Some patchy rain will develop
OL,15,Facross Orkney this turning heavier
OL,16,Ftowards midnight and extending to
OL,17,FShetland overnight. Strengthening
OL,18,Fsouth or southeast wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
