OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA wet start to the day with
OL,6,Fsome heavy rain, soon brightening up
OL,7,Fto sunshine and scattered showers over
OL,8,FOrkney, then Shetland brightening in
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday will be a very showery day,
OL,13,Fwhile Orkney will be windy too. Sunny
OL,14,Fintervals and some lighter showers on
OL,15,FSunday. Bright start Monday, cloudy
OL,16,Fwith a little rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
